{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 ≥ 0 then shape(v_1, v_2) ≥ 2 else shape(v_1, v_2 + ndim(v_1)) ≥ 2
>>
Rule 4 (1-dimensional sample points x must have at least 2 elements)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = 1 then shape(v_1, 0) ≥ 2
>>
